  "execution_output": "SOURCE: https://smash-hit.fandom.com/wiki/Checkpoint_4\n Just a moment... Enable JavaScript and cookies to continue \n\nSOURCE: https://douglasholmquist.bandcamp.com/album/smash-hit-ost\n Smash Hit OST | Douglas Holmquist --> --> --> --> --> --> --> --> --> --> --> --> --> --> --> --> --> --> --> + add album track merch listening party new artist existing artist stats × See all results No matching results Try a different filter or a new search keyword. Search all Bandcamp artists, tracks, and albums cancel partner × See all results No matching results Try a different filter or a new search keyword. Search all Bandcamp artists, tracks, and albums cancel 0 || artistsMenu.linkedNonLabelMemberBands().length > 1) }\"> = 1 && loggedInBand() --> artists PRO view site edit profile tools subscription subscription view collection purchases 0 --> 10\" placeholder=\"Search all artists\"> no results 1 --> showLinkedBands(!showLinkedBands())\" data-test=\"linked-accounts-header\"> settings help log out sign up log in Get fresh music recommendations delivered to your inbox every Friday. music merch community Smash Hit OST by Douglas Holmquist supported by chettodust chettodust still one of my favorite video game soundtracks to this day. im so glad i have it on vinyl Favorite track: Part 2. alexmft1 alexmft1 this game is so nice i had to pay for it twice Favorite track: Part 9. garruth garruth I remember playing this game like crazy back then, and one of the biggest reasons for such is the downright magical soundtrack. Consider me glad it&#39;s on Bandcamp, because it&#39;s an instant buy. I adore Part 10 Section 3&#39;s music. A quiet, calm yet heavenly experience. Favorite track: Part 10. more... Chonostatics Thordinary kalithecatgirl waylon_k gemmiewow invertdark N_C_A_ Neo Void Star mooncastyre jacklookspale tonytoenails Cleo clragon alexbrony2 cyanflower aProfessionalFrog That_One_Nerd yipten Kettu fq33578 Fibbitts Tony Chiaramonte zyrkley 89o return voi